[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0923","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0923.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0772","title":"Tumbleweed Messaging Management System 默认账户漏洞","description":"Tumbleweed Messaging Management System (MMS) 4.6 及更早版本（原 Worldtalk Worldsecure）安装时默认创建名为 \"sa\" 的管理员账户且无密码保护。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接使用该默认账户无密码登录系统，获得完整管理权限，进而完全控制消息管理系统、窃取敏感邮件数据、篡改配置或发起进一步横向攻击。该漏洞影响 Tumbleweed MMS 4.6 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属高危漏洞。攻击者无需任何认证凭证，仅通过网络访问管理接口即可利用默认空密码账户直接登录，攻击条件极低、危害严重。建议立即修改默认账户密码、禁用或删除默认账户，并升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0772"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.950","remediation":"立即修改 Tumbleweed MMS 默认账户 \"sa\" 的空密码，设置符合复杂度要求的强密码（≥12位含大小写数字特殊字符）。升级至 Tumbleweed MMS 4.7 或更高版本（Axway 现已接管产品线）。若无法升级，请在数据库层面执行 ALTER USER sa IDENTIFIED BY '新强密码'，并配置账户锁定策略：登录失败 5 次锁定 30 分钟。同时在防火墙限制 MMS 管理端口（默认 8443/TCP）仅允许受信任 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0098.html","http://thompson.tumbleweed.com/NewKB/bulletin/UPFiles/sa-official.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1562","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0772","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0772.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ph7q-8jfj-8h3x/GHSA-ph7q-8jfj-8h3x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--85d27e37-7395-42fa-b3b0-25d88fa7b4c1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--85d27e37-7395-42fa-b3b0-25d88fa7b4c1.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0923.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0923.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0923.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0922","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0922.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0771","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 本地安全策略损坏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 本地安全策略存在 RPC 流量处理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 RPC 数据包，破坏本地安全策略配置，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS00-062 修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0771"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.823","remediation":"安装 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1（SP1）即可修复此漏洞；如无法部署 SP1，请安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-062 提供的独立补丁（KB269609）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上阻止 UDP 端口 137、138、139 和 443 以阻断外部 RPC 攻击；对于不提供网络服务的机器，可禁用 RPC Listener 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1613","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-062","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0771","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0771.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-062.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bec7b3d9-ab3e-4dae-b674-10ce30ad5551.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-062.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-78gg-3pq4-5rh6/GHSA-78gg-3pq4-5rh6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0922.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0920","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0920.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0770","title":"Microsoft IIS 文件权限规范化安全绕过漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 和 5.0 存在文件权限规范化绕过漏洞，由于对某些文件类型的访问控制权限继承机制处理不当，当父文件夹设置了较为宽松的权限时，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 请求绕过文件访问限制，获取本应受保护的敏感文件内容。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 及更早版本中运行的 IIS Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0770"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.697","remediation":"升级到 IIS 6.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，在 IIS 管理器中为每个站点单独设置文件权限，删除不必要的脚本映射（如 .htr、.idc、.shtm 等），并启用 URLScan 工具过滤恶意请求路径。同时确保 Web 根目录及子目录的 NTFS 权限遵循最小权限原则，禁止继承宽松的父目录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1565","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-057","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0770","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/43e06207f4a9b953766ed97d35ee32114db90355/2000/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0770.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0920.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0917","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0917.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0769","title":"O'Reilly WebSite Pro 任意文件上传与执行漏洞","description":"O'Reilly WebSite Pro 2.3.7 在安装时将 uploader.exe 程序设置为所有用户可执行权限，导致远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接调用该上传程序，向服务器上传并执行任意恶意文件。该漏洞影响 O'Reilly WebSite Pro 2.3.7 版本，攻击者只需能够访问目标服务器的 Web 服务即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0769"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.580","remediation":"立即删除或重命名 WebSite Pro 安装目录下的 uploader.exe 文件，或移除该文件对匿名用户的执行权限（chmod 750 uploader.exe）。在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面限制对 /uploader.exe 路径的外部访问。建议升级到不受影响的版本或迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96715834610888&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1611","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0769","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0769.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p2jx-rwxh-4rq2/GHSA-p2jx-rwxh-4rq2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f15a139a-c34e-4296-aab3-0e00f8041873.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0917.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0917.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0916","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0916.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0768","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 框架域验证绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 及 5.x 版本中存在框架域验证漏洞，浏览器窗口内框架的域验证函数未能正确校验来源，远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意框架的网页，诱使用户访问后绕过同源策略限制，读取客户端本地文件。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互配合，仅影响机密性，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0768"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.447","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-055 提供的补丁，该补丁适用于 Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 版本。如无法安装补丁，可将不受信任站点的安全区域中\"Active 脚本\"设置为禁用，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1564","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-055","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0768","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0768.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mcmc-pq28-m22x/GHSA-mcmc-pq28-m22x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--de3ebb34-a4d6-4f4e-a30e-7549c12e0fdc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--de3ebb34-a4d6-4f4e-a30e-7549c12e0fdc.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0916.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0915","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0915.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0767","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Scriptlet 渲染任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 中用于调用脚本小程序（Scriptlet）的 ActiveX 控件存在文件类型解析漏洞。该控件在处理非 HTML 文件时错误地将其渲染为可执行脚本内容，导致攻击者可以诱导用户访问恶意网页，从而读取目标系统上的任意本地文件，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击条件要求用户使用受影响版本的 IE 浏览器访问攻击者构造的恶意页面。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0767"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.320","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-055 提供的补丁，该补丁限制 Scriptlet Component 仅渲染 HTML 文件，并修复了框架域验证问题。对于 Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 用户，可通过 Windows Update 或从 https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-055 下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可将 Internet 区域的 Active Scripting 禁用作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1564","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-055","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0767","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0767.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7j3m-5478-cr36/GHSA-7j3m-5478-cr36.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f525013c-218b-49a3-93fb-f5d6e405e2cd.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f16f8a77389e4bc58a66c9547351335940b7ddb9/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f525013c-218b-49a3-93fb-f5d6e405e2cd.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0915.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0915.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0915.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0913","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0913.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0765","title":"Microsoft Office 2000 HTML解释器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2000 的 HTML 解释器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于在处理特制的长嵌入对象标签（object tag）时未正确验证输入长度，导致内存越界写入。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 object 标签的 Office 文档（如 PowerPoint、Excel、Word 文件），诱使用户打开后触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互才能利用，影响 Microsoft Office 2000 全系列产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0765"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26.080","remediation":"安装 Office 2000 SR-1 更新包，然后安装微软 MS00-056 安全公告提供的补丁（下载地址：https://office.microsoft.com/downloads/2000/Of9data.aspx）。如无法立即打补丁，可在 Word 2000 中通过「工具→选项→常规」启用「打开时确认转换」功能，防止自动解析恶意 HTML 文档中的对象标签。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1561","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-056","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0765","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0765.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rqm2-qh4g-xjjg/GHSA-rqm2-qh4g-xjjg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5d086cda-5861-4e06-9537-2dd380815a75.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0913.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0911","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0911.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0764","title":"Intel Express 500 系列交换机畸形IP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Intel Express 500 系列交换机在处理畸形 IP 数据包时存在缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标设备发送特制的畸形 IP 数据包，触发交换机处理异常，导致设备拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Intel Express 500 交换机固件版本 2.63 及 2.64，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前厂商已发布相关修复建议，建议用户升级固件版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0764"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25.963","remediation":"升级 Intel Express 500 系列交换机固件至 2.65 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2.63/2.64 版本中存在，2.65 已修复）。由于该产品已停止支持，如无法升级固件，可在网络边界部署入侵检测系统（IDS）过滤畸形 IP 分片包，或限制对受影响交换机的未授权网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0338.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1609","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0764","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0764.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-46vj-5wgx-vh7x/GHSA-46vj-5wgx-vh7x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f16f8a77389e4bc58a66c9547351335940b7ddb9/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0911.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0909","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0359","title":"thttpd If-Modified-Since 头缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"THTTPd（Trivial HTTP Server）在处理 HTTP 请求头时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 If-Modified-Since 请求头，即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃造成拒绝服务，或进一步执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 THTTPd 2.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至最新版本或限制对 THTTPd 服务的网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0359"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33.177","remediation":"升级 thttpd 至 2.21 或更高版本，该版本修复了 If-Modified-Since 头处理中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截长度超过 1024 字节的 If-Modified-Since 请求头作为临时缓解措施。对于仍在运行旧版 thttpd 的生产环境，建议迁移至 actively maintained 的 HTTP 服务器（如 Nginx 或 Apache）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/1626.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_30.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1248","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0359.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0359.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0359","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0359.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0359.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mrrh-jg5h-m3rp/GHSA-mrrh-jg5h-m3rp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0359.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0909.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0909.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0904","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0904.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0761","title":"IBM OS2 Warp FTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM OS/2 Warp 4.5 的 FTP 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 登录过程提交超长用户名，触发缓冲区溢出，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 OS/2 Warp 4.0/4.2/4.3/4.5 等多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0761"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25.567","remediation":"IBM 已发布针对 OS/2 Warp 4.5 FTP 服务器的补丁 IC27721，可从 IBM FTP 服务器下载安装（路径：ps/products/tcpip/fixes/v4.3os2/ic27721/README）。由于 OS/2 系统已停止官方支持，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统；如无法迁移，应在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（21）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0166.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0761","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0761.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jm93-vrxg-7qhg/GHSA-jm93-vrxg-7qhg.json","https://github.com/KennaSecurity/toolkit/blob/6c393a10992b43d45104311cf53f32c08e12fdbd/spec/tasks/connectors/cylera/cylera_task_spec.rb","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0904.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0903","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0903.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0758","title":"Lyris List Manager 权限提升漏洞","description":"Lyris List Manager 3 和 4 版本的 Web 管理界面存在隐藏表单字段操纵漏洞。列表订阅者可通过修改页面中 `list_admin` 隐藏表单字段的值来获取管理员访问权限，本质上是服务端未对前端提交的敏感参数进行充分校验。攻击者只需拥有合法订阅者账号即可利用，无需身份认证绕过，成功后可完全控制邮件列表管理系统，包括修改配置、管理用户及查看敏感信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0758"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25.193","remediation":"升级到 Lyris ListManager 5.0 或更高版本（厂商已修复该问题）。如无法升级，需修改 Web 应用代码，在服务端对 list_admin 字段进行权限校验，禁止普通订阅者提交该字段；同时移除 HTML 表单中所有隐藏的管理员权限字段，改为服务端 session 鉴权。鉴于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件列表管理平台（如 Mailman、Sympa 或 L-Soft LISTSERV）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0149.html","http://www.lyris.com/lm/lm_updates.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1584","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0758","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0758.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/2072.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vfmq-w45j-w9m6/GHSA-vfmq-w45j-w9m6.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-472.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0903.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0903.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0903.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0901","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0901.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0756","title":"Microsoft Outlook 98/2000 vCard 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 98/2000 在处理 vCard（.vcf）文件时未对超长或畸形字段进行正确验证，存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的 vCard 邮件附件，当用户使用 Outlook 打开该附件时，畸形的 vCard 数据会导致 Outlook 应用程序崩溃或异常退出，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击条件简单，影响 Microsoft Outlook 98 及 2000 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0756"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.937","remediation":"建议升级到 Outlook 2000 Service Pack 3 或更高版本，该补丁已修复 vCard 解析中的缓冲区处理缺陷。如无法升级，可在 Outlook 中禁用自动预览 vCard 附件功能，并将安全区域设置为「受限站点」以防止自动加载 .vcf 文件。同时教育用户不要打开来自不可信来源的 vCard 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1633","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Springmail.105.967737080.0.16997300%40www.springmail.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0756","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0756.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3fm9-pr9w-23q9/GHSA-3fm9-pr9w-23q9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7e9d0f9f6e96f881defceb153c169913a330643d/2000.tsv","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1633/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0901.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0898","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0898.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0755","title":"HP HP-UX newgrp 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.00 系统中的 newgrp 命令存在权限提升漏洞。newgrp 命令用于切换用户所属组，由于其对用户输入参数处理不当，本地攻击者可通过精心构造的参数调用 newgrp 命令，利用该漏洞获取超出自身权限的访问能力，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，攻击复杂度较低，成功利用后可获取受影响系统的部分机密性、完整性和可用性控制权。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0755"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.813","remediation":"立即安装 HP 官方安全公告 HPSBUX0008-121 提供的补丁，可通过 HP IT Resource Center 搜索对应补丁编号获取。如无法安装补丁，执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/newgrp` 移除 setuid 位以阻断提权路径，注意此操作可能影响依赖 newgrp 切换组的脚本正常运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0755","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0755.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wrcj-gm3v-fgv6/GHSA-wrcj-gm3v-fgv6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0898.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0897","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0897.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0754","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager 密码加密漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NNM) 6.1 版本存在密码加密缺陷，该漏洞源于对敏感凭据的加密处理不当，导致本地攻击者可通过访问系统文件或日志获取加密后的密码信息，进而可能破解或绕过认证机制。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可对系统完整性造成部分影响。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0754"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.693","remediation":"建议立即升级至 HP OpenView NNM 7.01 或更高版本，该版本已修复密码明文存储问题。如无法升级，应限制对 NNM 配置文件（如 $OV_CONF/ov.conf 及相关密码文件）的本地访问权限，仅允许管理员账户读取，并启用操作系统级文件审计日志监控异常访问。同时避免在多用户共享系统上部署 NNM 6.1。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0754","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0754.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xqwv-q7pr-7f9f/GHSA-xqwv-q7pr-7f9f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7e9d0f9f6e96f881defceb153c169913a330643d/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--588f2cd0-bb90-4bf0-b066-8e973133ff79.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0897.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0896","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0896.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0753","title":"Microsoft Outlook 邮件客户端信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 邮件客户端在处理 RTF（Rich Text Format）格式邮件时，会将发件人计算机的物理路径信息嵌入到 winmail.dat 附件中。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的 RTF 格式邮件，当收件人打开该邮件时，winmail.dat 附件会泄露发件人本地的文件系统路径信息。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，可能导致攻击者获取目标系统的目录结构等敏感信息，为进一步攻击提供线索。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0753"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.563","remediation":"升级 Microsoft Outlook 至 2000 年 8 月之后的安全更新版本，或安装 Office 2000 Service Release 1/1a (SR-1/SR-1a)。临时缓解措施：在邮件格式设置中将撰写模式改为纯文本而非 RTF 格式，避免 winmail.dat 附件泄露本地路径信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/201422","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/78240","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1631","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5508","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0753","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0753.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blo